Browser [icon: monitor, color: blue] {
  Store [icon: database, label: "Zustand store"]
  Graph engine [icon: share-2, label: "graphology · weighted graph · Dijkstra · Louvain"]
  Search index [icon: search, label: "Orama · BM25 + vector hybrid"]
  GraphRAG engine [icon: zap, label: "GraphRAG · route · search · 2-hop · rank · subgraph"]
  Views [icon: layout, color: blue] {
    Explore 3D [icon: globe, label: "Explore · 3D graph"]
    Lineage 2D [icon: git-branch, label: "Lineage · 2D diagram"]
    Read [icon: book-open, label: "Read · scripts · commentaries"]
    Ask [icon: message-circle, label: "Ask · Pārtha-Sārathi"]
    Reflect [icon: edit, label: "Reflect · private journal"]
  }
  Journal store [icon: lock, label: "IndexedDB · thoughts never leave the device"]
  Offline cache [icon: wifi-off, label: "Service worker · works offline"]
}

LLM providers [icon: cpu, color: red] {
  Groq [icon: zap]
  OpenRouter [icon: shuffle]
  OpenAI [icon: aperture]
  xAI [icon: x-circle]
  Ollama [icon: home, label: "Ollama · local"]
}

Gita dataset, Vedic scriptures > Resilient fetch
Resilient fetch > Graph compiler > Curated layers > Integrity gate
Integrity gate > Static data: writes JSON
Integrity gate > Precompute, Embeddings
Precompute, Embeddings > Static data
Static data > Store: fetched once
Static data > Offline cache: cached
App shell > Views
Store > Graph engine, Search index
Graph engine, Search index > GraphRAG engine
GraphRAG engine > Views: lights up the subgraph
GraphRAG engine > Chat relay: context + your own key
Chat relay > LLM providers: streamed answer
Reflect <> Journal store
Chapter audio, Verse audio --> Read: recitation

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [connection: >, label: "data or request"]
  [connection: -->, label: "streamed from a third party"]
}
